      },
      {
        "text": "References in this document to \u201cParamount,\u201d the \u201cCompany,\u201d \u201cwe,\u201d \u201cus\u201d and \u201cour\u201d refer to Paramount Global and its consolidated subsidiaries, unless the context otherwise requires.",
